# ============================================================
#  .gitignore BLINDADO — Playa Blanca
#  Regla: NADA de secretos ni PII de clientes entra a git.
# ============================================================

# ===== SECRETOS (tokens Meta / HubSpot / CAPI / Clarity / DASH_KEY) =====
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
config.json
**/config.json

# ===== PII DE CLIENTES (leads / compradores) — JAMÁS subir =====
leads_db.json
**/leads_db.json
_*.json
**/_*.json
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.xls

# ===== Documentos pesados / entregables binarios =====
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx
*.zip

# ===== Carpetas pesadas (a nube tipo Drive, NO a git) =====
fotos/
_ARCHIVO/
**/salidas/
**/salidas_reales/
**/work/
**/biblioteca_imagenes/
**/muestras_ia/

# ===== Sitios del cliente (tienen su PROPIO repo, no van en este) =====
web-panama-LIVE/
landing-colombia-full/

# ===== Dependencias / build =====
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.vercel/
**/.vercel/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ===== Sistema / logs =====
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log
**/logs/
